Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.55,0:00:04.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)显现吧然后 引导我走向胜利！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.44,0:00:07.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.107！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:12.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼时空龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.33,0:00:19.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)第107张 No.！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.58,0:00:24.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)喂 No.不是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.71,0:00:26.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总共只有100张吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.71,0:00:30.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 No.是被分为100张的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:30.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的记忆。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.53,0:00:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 这张 No.又是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.43,0:00:52.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)鲨鱼 璃绪小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.72,0:00:55.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)啧 球形场地！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.86,0:00:57.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经开打了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.82,0:00:58.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)小鸟小姐。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.09,0:01:01.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.55,0:01:02.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.04,0:01:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？ 在急什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.08,0:01:10.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就那么想快点打吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.58,0:01:14.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就让我来实现你的愿望吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.07,0:01:17.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用银河眼时空龙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.51,0:01:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.16,0:01:21.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我使用一个超量单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.68,0:01:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效对方怪兽的攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.42,0:01:29.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}月之屏障！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.43,0:01:33.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用装备在月之屏障和霍普上的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.82,0:01:35.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量·连锁{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.82,0:01:37.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巩固守备吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.49,0:01:38.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不错的策略。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.01,0:01:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.55,0:01:42.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你以为这样就能撑过去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.74,0:01:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？你的战斗应该已经结束了才对。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.47,0:01:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太天真了！银河眼时空龙的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.08,0:01:51.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.00,0:01:53.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.02,0:01:55.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当所有战斗结束时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.05,0:01:57.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个超量单元
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.04,0:01:59.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将场上的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.04,0:02:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼时空龙以外的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.85,0:02:03.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有效果无效{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.62,0:02:06.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将攻击力和守备力恢复原状。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.99,0:02:09.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}时空转生！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.21,0:02:15.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这……这是什么啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.58,0:02:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.49,0:02:30.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，在这个回合期间时空龙每有{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.12,0:02:32.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗中发动过效果的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.99,0:02:34.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每一张卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.69,0:02:36.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力就上升1000点。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.36,0:02:40.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}追溯时空，再次显现吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.28,0:02:45.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼时空龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.24,0:02:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，这个效果在自己的回合使用时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.11,0:02:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}时空龙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.48,0:02:57.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以再攻击一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.17,0:02:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.93,0:03:00.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽回到过去{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.44,0:03:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在那里选择对自己有利的未来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.38,0:03:04.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以做到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.17,0:03:05.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说还能做到这种事吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.59,0:03:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，塔奇恩·龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.15,0:03:12.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}歼灭的塔奇恩·螺旋！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.40,0:03:16.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不妙啊游马，这攻击是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.91,0:03:30.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.37,0:03:39.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.66,0:03:43.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.14,0:03:44.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}振作点。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.55,0:03:45.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太脆弱了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.43,0:03:48.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太脆弱了啊，人类这种东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.23,0:03:52.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被塔奇恩·龙的一击就打成了这副惨样。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.52,0:03:58.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错，九十九游马，站起来。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.15,0:04:00.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.23,0:04:02.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不把这决斗继续下去，我可就难办了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.42,0:04:04.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}站起来，狼狈地输掉{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.70,0:04:06.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后把 No.卡交给我。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.08,0:04:08.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.20,0:04:11.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.56,0:04:15.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？站不起来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.82,0:04:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就干脆投降吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.29,0:04:22.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 我才不会投降。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.58,0:04:26.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是在这里输了星光界就会 星光界就会…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.21,0:04:28.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.09,0:04:32.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 我绝对 我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.97,0:04:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}事到如今就由我来代替游马决斗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.25,0:04:37.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.76,0:04:50.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)那场决斗 由我来接手。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.63,0:04:53.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗… 你这家伙给我退下。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.17,0:04:55.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)在呼唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.28,0:04:57.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼在
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.70,0:04:59.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼唤着银河眼。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.29,0:05:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪 你…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.52,0:05:04.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跨越遥远的时空{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.19,0:05:07.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再次相逢的2条龙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.32,0:05:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正互相吸引着彼此。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.81,0:05:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}2条龙？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.63,0:05:16.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.78,0:05:41.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(欧比塔尔7)啊 卡 卡伊特大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.11,0:05:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡伊特……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.14,0:05:56.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来交给我吧你们去休息。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.77,0:05:57.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉了卡伊特。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.72,0:06:02.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别在意。而且 这也是我的问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.87,0:06:03.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的问题？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.09,0:06:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼的使用者有一个就够了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.11,0:06:09.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而那个人就是我。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.88,0:06:13.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}差不多该和败犬的寒暄结束了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.62,0:06:16.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然把我引到了这里{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.37,0:06:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你应该有和我战斗的觉悟吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.01,0:06:22.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是我引你来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.70,0:06:23.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是银河眼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.74,0:06:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼唤了银河眼。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.87,0:06:28.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 我就这样接替{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.67,0:06:29.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你没有异议吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.19,0:06:30.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.30,0:06:35.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.69,0:06:37.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.07,0:06:39.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼·时空龙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.47,0:06:40.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力恢复原状。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.72,0:06:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.29,0:06:45.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}另一位拥有银河眼的人啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.05,0:06:47.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我正求之不得。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.69,0:06:49.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}究竟谁才是真正的银河眼使用者
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.26,0:06:52.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让你好好见识一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.73,0:08:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《另一位银河眼使用者，快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.81,0:08:34.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}迟早要和他一战我本以为这是命中注定。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.54,0:08:38.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}时空龙之所以会狂暴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.53,0:08:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也是因为这个吗》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.16,0:08:42.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了，我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.16,0:08:44.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.02,0:08:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡 光子交易！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.23,0:08:48.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.69,0:08:50.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将1只光子怪兽送去墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.19,0:08:53.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组抽2张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.19,0:08:56.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 光子斩击者！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.04,0:08:59.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽在自己场上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.94,0:09:01.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有怪兽的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.35,0:09:02.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.06,0:09:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 我还要通常召唤光子粉碎者！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.12,0:09:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来召唤条件就凑齐了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.22,0:09:12.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.22,0:09:15.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将攻击力2000以上的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.25,0:09:16.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}2只怪兽解放！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.28,0:09:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在黑暗中闪耀的银河啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.20,0:09:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}化作希望之光寄宿于我仆从之身！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.98,0:09:29.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.17,0:09:40.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这两只果然是在互相呼唤吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.64,0:09:45.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事!?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.23,0:09:47.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼与
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.60,0:09:49.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼正在共鸣。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.09,0:09:52.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}感觉到了一股非同寻常的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.26,0:09:56.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这两只怪兽究竟有什么名堂？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.63,0:10:15.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.91,0:10:16.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无法理解！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.90,0:10:18.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是无法理解的现象。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.60,0:10:27.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当两体银河眼齐聚之时
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.34,0:10:29.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通往伟大力量的门将开启。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.39,0:10:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然早有耳闻。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.52,0:10:34.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.88,0:10:37.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 在这里悲惨落败的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.52,0:10:39.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你没必要知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.21,0:10:42.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那我就赢下来让你说给我听吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.14,0:10:45.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用银河眼光子龙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.25,0:10:47.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击银河眼快子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.81,0:10:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.37,0:10:55.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼光子龙的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.83,0:10:57.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将双方的怪兽除外！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.35,0:11:00.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 你的怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.39,0:11:01.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材就{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.87,0:11:03.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部被送入墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.41,0:11:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，因这个效果被除外的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.55,0:11:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗结束时
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.15,0:11:11.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤到场上！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.04,0:11:14.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，银河眼光子龙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.82,0:11:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有1个被送入墓地的超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.48,0:11:20.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力上升500点！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.97,0:11:26.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}失去了超量素材的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.45,0:11:28.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼时空龙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.79,0:11:30.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等同于被拔掉了獠牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.93,0:11:34.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可不一定？ 我发动速攻魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.05,0:11:36.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}瞬间超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.85,0:11:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在场上怪兽的超量
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.53,0:11:41.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有超量素材的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.68,0:11:44.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将其作为超量素材来使用！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.77,0:11:48.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真遗憾啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.61,0:11:51.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼时空龙的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.04,0:11:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.58,0:11:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将1张超量单位使用{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.55,0:11:58.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上的 时空龙以外的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.05,0:12:00.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有怪兽的效果无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.43,0:12:03.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力和守备力恢复原状！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.26,0:12:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}时空转生！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.59,0:12:15.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回溯时空 再次显现吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.92,0:12:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼时空龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.01,0:12:30.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 银河眼光子龙的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.60,0:12:32.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽效果就无法使用了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.00,0:12:35.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这场战斗里发动过效果的卡是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.66,0:12:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我使用过的1张速攻魔法超量单位。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.99,0:12:41.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 时空龙的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.37,0:12:43.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上升1000点！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.82,0:12:45.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《光子噪音
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.93,0:12:48.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对手怪兽的攻击无效{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.45,0:12:51.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上的光属性怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.62,0:12:54.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上升对手怪兽攻击力的数值。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.97,0:12:56.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要这招成了……》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.74,0:13:00.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.86,0:13:06.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.39,0:13:12.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.32,0:13:15.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡 牵引·逆转！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.30,0:13:19.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在自己怪兽区
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.67,0:13:21.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有超量单位时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.11,0:13:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对手的盖卡吸引过来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.34,0:13:27.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与这张卡一同 作为那个怪兽区的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.58,0:13:29.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量单位！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.39,0:13:30.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.70,0:13:41.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来你是一副逆转王牌被夺走的表情呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.63,0:13:44.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 银河眼·时空·龙的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.47,0:13:46.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量单位就是２个。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.69,0:13:48.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用银河眼·时空·龙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.93,0:13:51.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击银河眼·光子·龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.25,0:13:56.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动 速攻魔法 时空·驱动！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.71,0:13:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据这张卡的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.80,0:14:00.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上的１只时空·龙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.22,0:14:04.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会成为魔法·陷阱卡的效果对象。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.10,0:14:12.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力就算不相上下{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.14,0:14:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.94,0:14:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是 No.卡的话就破坏不了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.59,0:14:17.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 就在这一瞬间{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.60,0:14:21.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼时空龙的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.16,0:14:22.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.32,0:14:25.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.36,0:14:29.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}时空转生！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.22,0:14:40.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶 又来啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.98,0:14:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这场战斗里发动过效果的卡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.46,0:14:46.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是时空驱动1张。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.52,0:14:49.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 银河眼时空龙的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.32,0:14:49.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.99,0:14:51.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上升1000点！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.16,0:14:54.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}时空驱动并不只是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.47,0:14:55.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了守护时空龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.57,0:14:58.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过它来提升攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.80,0:15:01.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对手打得体无完肤是为了将其彻底击溃。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.63,0:15:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去可不妙啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.51,0:15:08.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能死在高贵龙爪之下，你就将此视为无上荣耀吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.39,0:15:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}感到光荣吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.38,0:15:12.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用银河眼·时空·龙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.37,0:15:13.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.07,0:15:17.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}歼灭的时空螺旋！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.07,0:15:27.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海马。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.47,0:15:29.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵 这样一来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.78,0:15:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真正的银河眼使用者就是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.24,0:15:39.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.67,0:15:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能 怎么会？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.52,0:15:48.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动了墓地中光子·幽灵的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.89,0:15:50.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.50,0:15:52.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.57,0:15:54.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}时空驱动能防住的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.47,0:15:56.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有魔法和陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.54,0:15:58.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说怪兽效果不在对象范围内。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.04,0:16:01.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我在受到直接攻击的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.63,0:16:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将墓地里的光子·幽灵除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.55,0:16:06.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地让1只光子怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.65,0:16:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果无效{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.98,0:16:10.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力下降1000点
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.10,0:16:11.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.46,0:16:14.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 这只怪兽在召唤的回合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.02,0:16:16.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会在战斗中被破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.35,0:16:18.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 对我造成的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.94,0:16:20.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成了2000。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.97,0:16:23.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.58,0:16:27.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}塔奇恩·龙 的攻击力也恢复原状。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.55,0:16:30.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.27,0:16:34.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡死者苏生。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.16,0:16:37.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地特殊召唤光子·斩击者。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.62,0:16:42.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着 从手牌召唤光子·环。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.41,0:16:51.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.43,0:16:54.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡 升阶魔法！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.52,0:16:58.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将自己场上的怪兽等级
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.15,0:17:00.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部变成其中最高的等级。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.68,0:17:03.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级8的怪兽有3只。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.00,0:17:04.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.24,0:17:11.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级8的银河眼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.17,0:17:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和光子斩击者{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.40,0:17:14.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子驱逐者进行叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.05,0:17:16.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.25,0:17:18.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.70,0:17:20.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.43,0:17:22.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}翻涌的银河啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.99,0:17:27.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}此刻化作怒涛之光现身吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.34,0:17:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降临吧，我的灵魂。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.24,0:17:37.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.72,0:17:48.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦 这就是。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.95,0:17:50.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼光子龙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.99,0:17:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在超量召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.79,0:17:54.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}除了这只怪兽以外
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.14,0:17:56.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有怪兽效果无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.72,0:17:58.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子咆哮！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.77,0:18:05.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过将怪兽效果无效化
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.48,0:18:08.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夺走 No.怪兽只能被 No.怪兽破坏的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.64,0:18:09.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一特性。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.13,0:18:12.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是新银河眼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.13,0:18:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被称为 No.杀手的原因吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.16,0:18:17.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我使用1个超量单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.42,0:18:20.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将场上的 除了这只怪兽以外的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.25,0:18:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.46,0:18:22.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部送去墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.92,0:18:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后每有1个
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.06,0:18:29.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被送去墓地的超量单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.39,0:18:31.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力上升500点。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.40,0:18:38.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！新银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.54,0:18:41.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终极光子流！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.86,0:18:56.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我这回合结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.46,0:19:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好 好啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.48,0:19:04.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼果然名不虚传
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.62,0:19:06.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是要这样才对嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.49,0:19:07.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘴硬。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.28,0:19:10.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.51,0:19:13.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也来用一下这个吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.37,0:19:17.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡 死者苏生！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.14,0:19:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.64,0:19:21.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤银河眼时空龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.82,0:19:33.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样的话，才配得上我拿出真本事。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.65,0:19:38.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.07,0:19:59.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安……终于露出真面目了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.70,0:20:03.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此那就是你们的真正姿态吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.53,0:20:05.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在就让你们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.79,0:20:08.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}见识一下真正的巴利安之力。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.13,0:20:12.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动升阶魔法 巴利安之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.21,0:20:13.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.99,0:20:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将自己的怪兽阶级提升{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.82,0:20:20.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤混沌超量怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.64,0:20:21.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将阶级8的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.75,0:20:25.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以银河眼时空龙进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.14,0:20:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用1只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.70,0:20:30.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.30,0:20:34.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自混沌中诞生的巴利安之力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.54,0:20:38.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}寄宿于号数之中孕育出新的混沌。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.92,0:20:42.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌异变！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.46,0:20:49.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贯穿汹涌的银河自时间诞生之前苏醒吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.18,0:20:53.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超越永恒之龙之星！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.29,0:20:56.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌号数107！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.70,0:21:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼时空龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.40,0:21:06.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼时空龙！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.09,0:21:12.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不好！能量太大了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.79,0:21:15.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去的话，球形力场要！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.22,0:21:27.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗就交给你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.14,0:21:29.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吾名乃米扎艾尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.61,0:21:32.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终有一日，将成为支配
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.84,0:21:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两只银河眼之人！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.26,0:21:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.36,0:21:50.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轨道7)凯特大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.28,0:23:44.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.52,0:23:47.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.05,0:23:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
